# ARRVD invitation links (https://futodama.app/arrvd/invite/<id>#<token>)
# open the app directly via iOS Universal Links when it is installed —
# this rule only ever applies to a browser that did NOT hand the link to
# the app (not installed, or opened via Safari/an in-app browser that
# skipped Universal Link handling). 200 (rewrite, not a redirect) so the
# URL — and therefore the token in its fragment, which is never sent to
# this or any server — stays exactly as the user opened it.
/arrvd/invite/*  /arrvd/invite-fallback.html  200
